<title>NETHERLANDS: VHS 1996 NET PROFIT SLIGHTLY LOWER.</title>
<headline>VHS 1996 NET PROFIT SLIGHTLY LOWER.</headline>
<dateline>THE HAGUE 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     1.31 vs   n.a.</p>
<p>    Net profit			    13.1  vs  13.4</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			17.8  vs  13.4</p>
<p>    Profit on sales of property	3.1  vs  11.5</p>
<p>    Tax					4.7  vs  nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Property investment fund VHS Onroerend Goed NV said</p>
<p>its net asset value per share had risen by 26 percent to 6.26</p>
<p>guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
